      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Video utilities, all in memory until something writes.\n\n1. 48 frames become a VIDEO (PD Images To Video, 24 fps) and PD Output writes an mp4.\n2. PD Video Get Frame seeks to one frame (here the last); PD Video To Images decodes a range (frames 12-35, every 2nd); PD Image From Batch picks one image (-1 = last).\n3. PD Switch chooses which single frame to preview (select 0 or 1).\n4. PD Load reads the written mp4 back and previews it as a playable clip.\n5. PD Sound chimes when the queue finishes."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Video utilities, all in memory until something writes.\n\n1. 48 frames become a VIDEO (PD Images To Video, 24 fps) and PD Output writes an mp4.\n2. PD Video Get Frame seeks to one frame (here the last); PD Video To Images decodes a range (frames 12-35, every 2nd); PD Image From Batch picks one image (-1 = last).\n3. PD Switch chooses which single frame to preview (select 0 or 1).\n4. PD Load reads the written mp4 back and previews it as a playable clip.\n5. PD Sound chimes when the queue finishes."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
